shape theory.physics.u1 : theory.physics.gauge {
  type: theorem
  layer: 0
  """
// Theorem 3.3 (Phase Symmetry / U(1)).
// Each generator independently projected as a value produces a
// U(1) phase that rotates continuously. Three generators give
// three independent U(1) symmetries.
//
// A single generator projected as a value gives a one-parameter
// continuous symmetry. The only one-parameter continuous Lie group
// is U(1).
//
// U(1)_X, U(1)_Y, U(1)_Z
//
// These provide 3 dimensions of translational motion, one per
// generator. Electromagnetism is U(1): electromagnetic waves
// propagate in any direction, spanning all three generators.
//
// Derives from: theory.physics.gauge
  """
}
